:: Q1 {"position":"375,425","size":"100,100"}
You find a wallet with $200 and the owner's ID.

(link: "Return it with everything inside")[
(set: $just to $just + 1)
(set: $virtue to $virtue + 1)
(goto: "Q2")
]

(link: "Keep the money and report the crime")[
(set: $rights to $rights + 1)
(goto: "Q2")
]

(link: "Donate the money to charity")[
(set: $util to $util + 1)
(goto: "Q2")
]

(link: "Contact the owner and make sure they’re okay")[
(set: $cgood to $cgood + 1)
(goto: "Q2")
]


:: Q2 {"position":"375,550","size":"100,100"}
A friend asks if you like their new outfit, but you think it looks bad.

(link: "Tell the truth")[
(set: $just to $just + 1)
(goto: "Q3")
]

(link: "Lie to spare their feelings")[
(set: $cgood to $cgood + 1)
(goto: "Q3")
]

(link: "Give a balanced answer (some truth, some kindness)")[
(set: $virtue to $virtue + 1)
(goto: "Q3")
]

(link: "Say its their right to choose to wear it out")[
(set: $rights to $rights + 1)
(goto: "Q3")
]


:: Q3 {"position":"375,675","size":"100,100"}
You see a stranger struggling to carry groceries.

(link: "Help them because it’s the right thing to do")[
(set: $just to $just + 1)
(set: $rights to $rights + 1)
(goto: "Q4")
]

(link: "Help them because it builds good character")[
(set: $virtue to $virtue + 1)
(goto: "Q4")
]

(link: "Help because they clearly need support")[
(set: $cgood to $cgood + 1)
(goto: "Q4")
]

(link: "Help because it increases overall happiness")[
(set: $util to $util + 1)
(goto: "Q4")
]


:: Q4 {"position":"375,800","size":"100,100"}
You could break a small rule to help many people.

(link: "Follow the rule no matter what")[
(set: $just to $just + 1)
(goto: "Q5")
]

(link: "Break the rule if it helps the most people")[
(set: $util to $util + 1)
(goto: "Q5")
]

(link: "Do it because it is a good thing to do")[
(set: $virtue to $virtue + 1)
(set: $rights to $rights + 1)
(goto: "Q5")
]

(link: "Consider how it affects the people involved personally")[
(set: $cgood to $cgood + 1)
(goto: "Q5")
]


:: Q5 {"position":"375,925","size":"100,100"}
You have to make a tough decision that affects others.

(link: "Choose the option with the best overall outcome")[
(set: $util to $util + 1)
(goto: "Results")
]

(link: "Stick to your moral rules")[
(set: $just to $just + 1)
(goto: "Results")
]

(link: "Act based on your character and values")[
(set: $virtue to $virtue + 1)
(goto: "Results")
]

(link: "Do not do it because it interferes with there individual rights")[
(set: $rights to $rights + 1)
(goto: "Results")
]

(link: "Focus on relationships and care for others")[
(set: $cgood to $cgood + 1)
(goto: "Results")
]


:: Results {"position":"375,1050","size":"100,100"}
Your results:

(if: $util >= $just and $util >= $virtue and $util >= $rights and $util >= $cgood)[
You align most with The Utilitarian Approach.

You focus on outcomes and believe the best action is the one that creates the greatest good for the most people.
]

(else-if: $just >= $util and $just >= $virtue and $just >= $rights and $just >= $cgood)[
You align most with The Justice Approach.

You believe in following rules and duties, no matter the outcome.
]

(else-if: $virtue >= $util and $virtue >= $just and $virtue >= $rights and $virtue >= $cgood)[
You align most with The Virtue Approach.

You focus on being a good person and acting with strong moral character.
]

(else-if: $rights >= $util and $rights >= $just and $rights >= $virtue and $rights >= $cgood)[
You align most with The Rights Approach.

You prioritize the individual rights of yourself and others over anything.
]

(else:)[
You align most with The Common Good Approach.

You focus on what does the most good for the relationships around you and compassion for others.
]


